{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "909e364f91082ebbd43a497cb91ac4045ea168a9b33c24b141fb87a3d71be7ef", "ja": "はぁ～♪\n昨日テレビで見たケーキ、\n美味しそうだったなぁ。", "zh": "哈啊～♪\n昨天在电视上看到的蛋糕，\n看起来真好吃呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "e76703078e2c6f6476c3de60c68df001a77af6b43704cbbf472889356e8afb60", "ja": "一度食べてみたいけど……\n完売続きで『幻のケーキ』\nなんて言われてるんだよね。", "zh": "虽然很想找机会尝一次……\n但因为总是卖光了，\n大家都叫它“梦幻蛋糕”呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0396_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "957a0f48527144e1bfb91e3219166c88673388d98e65a487bd120c8dcd740520", "ja": "朝早くからお店に並んだら\n買えたりするのかな？\nはぁ……ケーキ……。", "zh": "要是一大早就去店门口排队，\n说不定能买到呢？\n唉……蛋糕……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
